  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.38\n\nReleased on 2026-09-14.\n\nStarting a project now opens on a centered title on a dark frame, with no extra flags. Local renders use the faster capture path, and the default encode is the cleaner looks setting.\n\n## Features\n\n- **CLI:** `npx hyperframes init` scaffolds a centered title on a dark frame. Local render uses the faster capture path. The default quality is looks ([f059a6eb5](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/f059a6eb539e6289d20156f04eb04a43ddc8b806), [#3927](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/3927)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- **Skills:** The core skill now covers only how to write composition HTML. Planning and review docs live on the main HyperFrames skill ([95bea1631](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/95bea1631ff51dd38332f69daef3a1e1849d51c6), [#3928](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/3928)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.37...v0.8.38\n",
